# Routes

All routes prerender with `trailingSlash = 'always'` (`src/routes/+layout.js`). URLs sit under base `/system-design-copilot`.

## App shell

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `+layout.svelte` | Slim header (brand · progress · Topics), Coursera-style underline tabs, context-aware sidebar, skip link |
| `+layout.js` | `prerender`, trailing slash |

**Tabs:** Home · System Design · Low Level · DSA · AI · Practice (`src/lib/navigation.js`).

**Sidebar:** On Home, LeetCode-style **tracks** list (5 flows + progress). In a flow/module/lesson, search + module accordion for the active flow only. `/` focuses search when in a flow.

Sidebar UI state: localStorage `system-design-copilot-sidebar-v4` (inline in layout, not a store). Helpers: `navigation.js`, `sidebar.js`.

## Pages

| Route | Files | Purpose |
|-------|-------|---------|
| `/` | `+page.svelte` | Home: hero, five flow cards, resume card, featured HLD modules, study tracks, curriculum map + `ProgressControls` |
| `/flow/[flow]/` | `flow/[flow]/+page.js`, `+page.svelte` | Flow roadmap: progress, focus areas, module runway. Entries from `courseFlows` |
| `/module/[module]/` | `module/[module]/+page.js`, `+page.svelte` | Module overview + lesson runway |
| `/module/[module]/lesson/[lesson]/` | `…/+page.js`, `+page.svelte` | **Main workspace**: read content, topic lab, simulation (HLD), practice IDE by flow, solutions |

## Flow slugs

`high-level-design` · `low-level-design` · `data-structures-and-algorithms` · `ai-engineer` · `interview-questions`

## Lesson URL / id

- URL: `{base}/module/{moduleSlug}/lesson/{lessonSlug}/`
- Lesson id: `{moduleSlug}/{lessonSlug}` (normalized in `courseData.js`)

## Lesson page composition

Order on `module/…/lesson/…/+page.svelte`:

1. Read body + rail (diagram, checklist, pitfalls, prompts)
2. AI study guide + `MLPracticeIDE` (ai-engineer)
3. `LessonExplorer` if `lesson.interactive`
4. `SimulationIDE` if HLD + simulation config
5. `QuestionBankIDE` | `DsaPracticeIDE` | `PracticeIDE` by flow
6. `LessonSolutionPanel` when lesson is in `solutionLessonIds`
